@startuml
title SwapCampus 核心实体子图：支撑域

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam nodesep 90

hide methods
left to right direction

class "用户" as User {
  +用户ID
  +昵称
  +信用分
}

package "消息与治理" {
  class "会话" as Conversation {
    +会话ID
    +更新时间
  }

  class "消息" as Message {
    +消息ID
    +类型
    +内容
  }

  class "举报" as Report {
    +举报ID
    +原因
    +状态
  }

  class "审计日志" as AuditLog {
    +日志ID
    +动作
    +目标
  }
}

package "信用与异步" {
  class "积分资产" as UserCreditAsset {
    +用户ID
    +可用积分
    +累计积分
  }

  class "积分流水" as CreditPointLedger {
    +流水ID
    +变动
    +来源
    +余额
  }

  class "兑换订单" as CreditRedeemOrder {
    +兑换ID
    +奖励
    +状态
  }

  class "出站事件" as OutboxEvent {
    +事件ID
    +主题
    +类型
    +状态
  }
}

User -[hidden]right- Conversation
Conversation -[hidden]down- Message
Conversation -[hidden]down- Report
Report -[hidden]down- AuditLog
User -[hidden]right- UserCreditAsset
UserCreditAsset -[hidden]down- CreditPointLedger
UserCreditAsset -[hidden]right- CreditRedeemOrder
CreditRedeemOrder -[hidden]down- OutboxEvent

User "1" -right- "0..*" Conversation : 发起 / 参与
Conversation "1" -down- "0..*" Message : 包含
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" Report : 发起 / 被举报 / 处理
User "0..1" -[norank]right- "0..*" AuditLog : 执行

User "1" -down- "0..1" UserCreditAsset : 持有
UserCreditAsset "1" -down- "0..*" CreditPointLedger : 生成流水
UserCreditAsset "1" -right- "0..*" CreditRedeemOrder : 产生兑换单

note bottom of Conversation
会话可以挂接商品、
商品订单或服务订单。
这些上下文实体在本图省略。
end note

note bottom of Report
举报既可以指向用户，
也可以指向商品或服务发布。
这里不展开多态目标。
end note

note bottom of OutboxEvent
出站事件承接异步副作用。
商品、订单、用户、
服务发布等领域事件
都会写入这里。
end note

@enduml
